      "widgets_values": [
        "# PART 1 - Plan from an audio file\n\nThis workflow creates the timeline and prompts used by Parts 2 and 3. No image or video model runs here, so it is fast to iterate.\n\n**1. Load your song**, then queue the workflow.\n\n**2. Analyse** transcribes the lyrics and divides the song into 5-10 second, beat-aware segments.\n\n**3. Review the green STOP node.** Choose a `style_preset`, add an optional `style_description`, and adjust segment timing if needed. The subject, locations, card prompts, and motion prompts are derived from the song unless you fill the optional overrides.\n\n**4. Approve and save.** `approve_timeline` marks the run you want to continue. Part 1 saves `project.json` and a copy of the song under:\n\n`output/storyboard_projects/<project>__<date-time>__<id>/`\n\nOpen Part 2 and keep `<< newest run >>`, or reload the browser and select this run explicitly. Each Part 1 queue creates a new run, so existing work is not overwritten."
      ],
      "title": "READ ME",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
